  "reason": "Evidence: config_009 (multimodal, scgpt+resnet50, weighted fusion) achieved 0.421 acc, while config_028 (image_only, resnet50) achieved only 0.208 acc — a 21-point gap showing RNA is critical. However, we cannot yet decompose how much of the 0.421 comes from RNA alone versus the multimodal combination. Question: config_038 (rna_only, singleprofile, scgpt) is a clean ablation of config_009 that isolates the RNA contribution. If RNA alone approaches ~0.40+, the image modality adds little and remaining budget should target RNA encoder/architecture improvements. If RNA alone is much lower (~0.20-0.30), the multimodal fusion is genuinely synergistic and we should prioritize multiprofile aggregation and fusion strategy experiments. With only 2 data points, this decomposition is the highest-information experiment to guide the remaining 7 trials efficiently."
}

